# Shopify code rules

- Multi-tenant: resolve shop from session/URL; load token from DB per shop — never one global env token.
- API host: `https://{shop}.myshopify.com/admin/api/{version}/graphql.json`
- `metafieldsSet`: max 250 per call; definitions from `shop_configs`, not hardcoded.
- Inventory spreadsheet: `inventorySetQuantities` + `compareQuantity`; deltas: `inventoryAdjustQuantities`; use `@idempotent(key:)`.
- Secrets: server-only; never `NEXT_PUBLIC_` for tokens; use `lib/encryption.ts`; never log decrypted tokens.
- Keep light: reuse helpers; no new service layers/packages without phase need; one Next.js deploy.
- Match existing folder layout in `PROJECT.md` Section 9.
